<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Event Portal - Home</title>
    <style>
        /* Global Styles */
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        nav {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #3498db;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }

        /* Featured Events Section */
        .events-section {
            padding: 30px 20px 60px 20px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .events-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .event-grid {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .event-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 300px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .event-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .event-card h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .event-card p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .card-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2ecc71;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

        .card-btn:hover {
            background-color: #27ae60;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Campus Events</div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="events.html">Events</a></li>
            <li><a href="register.html">Register</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to Campus Event Portal</h1>
        <p>Manage and register for all university and college events easily in one place.</p>
        <a href="events.html" class="btn">Explore Events</a>
    </div>

    <div class="events-section">
        <h2>Upcoming Featured Events</h2>
        <div class="event-grid">
            <div class="event-card">
                <h3>Tech Hackathon 2026</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 15th March 2026</p>
                <p>Showcase your coding skills, build innovative apps, and win exciting cash prizes.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="event-card">
                <h3>Annual Cultural Fest</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 22nd March 2026</p>
                <p>Join us for electrifying dance, music, drama competitions, and celebrity nights.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="event-card">
                <h3>Inter-College Sports Meet</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 5th April 2026</p>
                <p>Compete in cricket, football, basketball, athletics, and indoor gaming tournaments.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Campus Event Portal | Week 2 - Commit 1</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
